WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:17.549
"Grr!" Roxy struggled in the chocolate syrup.

2
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:20.220
It was thick and heavy.

3
00:00:20.221 --> 00:00:22.016
Slowly she stood up.

4
00:00:22.017 --> 00:00:24.653
Then she spun around.

5
00:00:24.654 --> 00:00:28.638
She spun faster and faster, like a tornado.

6
00:00:28.639 --> 00:00:33.048
Drops of syrup flew off of her and splattered all over.

7
00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:35.362
Soon Roxy was clean.

8
00:00:35.363 --> 00:00:39.090
She looked around. "Where's Le Sweet?"

9
00:00:39.091 --> 00:00:43.262
Roxy flew out a window. "There he is!"

10
00:00:43.263 --> 00:00:46.820
Le Sweet was driving a delivery truck on the road below.

11
00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:49.415
The truck was zooming toward the city.

12
00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:52.442
A different delivery truck lay on its side.

13
00:00:52.443 --> 00:00:54.623
Roxy flew to the second truck.

14
00:00:54.624 --> 00:00:56.539
The driver stood next to it.

15
00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:59.084
"What happened?" Roxy asked.

16
00:00:59.085 --> 00:01:01.362
The driver threw his hands in the air.

17
00:01:01.363 --> 00:01:04.303
"Le Sweet ran me off the road!

18
00:01:04.304 --> 00:01:06.826
Then he stole my delivery route.

19
00:01:06.827 --> 00:01:10.836
He said I'd never deliver my whole-grain cookies again.

20
00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:14.757
From now on, people are only eating Le Sweet donuts.

21
00:01:14.758 --> 00:01:17.115
The man is crazy!"

22
00:01:17.116 --> 00:01:20.033
"Where was your next delivery?" Roxy asked.

23
00:01:20.034 --> 00:01:23.305
"Metro City Elementary School," the man said.

24
00:01:23.306 --> 00:01:29.016
Roxy gulped. "We need to go there right now—fast!"

25
00:01:29.017 --> 00:01:31.624
She grabbed the driver with one hand.

26
00:01:31.625 --> 00:01:33.658
She grabbed the truck with the other hand.

27
00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:38.676
Zoom! Roxy shot through the sky!

28
00:01:38.677 --> 00:01:41.552
The driver smiled. "Wow!"

29
00:01:41.553 --> 00:01:44.763
As she flew over the city, Roxy looked down.

30
00:01:44.764 --> 00:01:46.981
She saw the Mighty Man actor.

31
00:01:46.982 --> 00:01:49.705
He was taking a selfie with someone.

32
00:01:49.706 --> 00:01:51.870
"Whew," Roxy thought.

33
00:01:51.871 --> 00:01:58.672
"He looks fine now. People don't stay zombies forever!"

34
00:01:58.673 --> 00:02:03.580
As the kids ate lunch in the cafeteria, a man walked in.

35
00:02:03.581 --> 00:02:06.767
He carried a stack of boxes.

36
00:02:06.768 --> 00:02:09.794
"My name is Pete Le Sweet," he said.

37
00:02:09.795 --> 00:02:13.846
"I have free donuts for everyone!"

38
00:02:13.847 --> 00:02:17.043
Everyone clapped and cheered.

39
00:02:17.044 --> 00:02:21.503
Le Sweet held up a donut. "Who wants the first one?"

40
00:02:21.504 --> 00:02:24.711
"Me!" Jack ran over.

41
00:02:24.712 --> 00:02:27.031
Le Sweet handed him the donut.

42
00:02:27.032 --> 00:02:30.260
Suddenly the cafeteria doors flew open.

43
00:02:30.261 --> 00:02:33.024
"Don't eat that!" Roxy shouted.

44
00:02:33.025 --> 00:02:34.440
Jack jumped.

45
00:02:34.441 --> 00:02:36.717
The donut flew out of his hand.

46
00:02:36.718 --> 00:02:41.002
It went up in the air . . . and landed right in Le Sweet's mouth!

47
00:02:41.003 --> 00:02:47.901
"Gulp! Grargh!"

48
00:02:47.902 --> 00:02:50.165
Detective Smith rushed in.

49
00:02:50.166 --> 00:02:56.033
Roxy smiled. "You can take this zombie to jail, Detective!"

50
00:02:56.034 --> 00:03:00.701
The driver stepped forward. "Who wants cookies?"

51
00:03:00.702 --> 00:03:05.954
Everyone cheered.

52
00:03:05.955 --> 00:03:10.143
"You missed Rocket Girl!" Mara said to Roxy during recess.

53
00:03:10.144 --> 00:03:13.391
"Oh, that's too bad," Roxy said.

54
00:03:13.392 --> 00:03:16.035
Terrell gave Roxy a suspicious look.

55
00:03:16.036 --> 00:03:21.140
"You always miss Rocket Girl. I wonder why."

56
00:03:21.141 --> 00:03:24.281
"Uh . . ." Roxy didn't know what to say.

57
00:03:24.282 --> 00:03:27.706
"You missed something else too!" Jack said suddenly.

58
00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:31.368
"A weird guy ate a donut and turned into a zombie!"

59
00:03:31.369 --> 00:03:33.362
Roxy laughed.

60
00:03:33.363 --> 00:03:37.661
But Terrell still had that suspicious look on his face.
